cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the EnrichR-based ground-truth snapshots in this
  repository, please cite both the software (this record, via the Zenodo DOI)
  and the accompanying manuscript.
title: "HCC scRNA-seq Cell Type Annotation Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Benchmarking pipeline for hepatocellular carcinoma single-cell RNA
  sequencing cell-type annotation tools, spanning reference-based classifiers,
  marker-database scoring, a Bayesian marker-gene model, a large language
  model API, and a single-cell foundation model, evaluated under both
  author-curated and EnrichR-derived ground truth, with an independent
  inferCNV-based malignant-cell validation.
type: software
authors:
